<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Four Media rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Four Media rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Paine Webber analyst Chris Dixon confirmed that he initiated coverage of Four Media Co with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- said &quot;terrific way to participate in shift from analog to digital&quot; in entertainment industry.</p>
<p>-- set price target of $14 by year-end.</p>
<p>-- set price target of $18 in 18 to 20 months with successful acquistion strategy.</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings of $0.12/shr for 1997 and $0.30 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- stock closed at 10 on Friday.</p>
</text>
